WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.707 --> 00:00:09.899
Tools has everything besides the lesson plan builder. Open the Tools tab.

2
00:00:09.899 --> 00:00:16.913
Say your lesson once: "Use my latest lesson plan". Every tool fills itself in.

3
00:00:16.913 --> 00:00:24.921
Search by what you need, in English or Malay: "kad imbas" finds the BBM guide.

4
00:00:24.921 --> 00:00:37.246
Classroom games are made from your words, for the projector, even offline.

5
00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:49.460
Activity ideas: filter by stage and time, then "Add to my lesson" puts one straight into your plan.

6
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:58.579
The BBM guide shows 25 teaching aids with pictures and how to make them.

7
00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:07.388
And "Improve with AI" writes a careful prompt for ChatGPT, Gemini or Canva AI, with no pupil names.

8
00:01:07.388 --> 00:01:09.791
Next: watch "Teach mode".
